      "id": "dav-without-preload",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/Dav/ApprovalPlugin.php:32 OCA\\Approval\\Dav\\ApprovalPlugin"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 DAV plugin listens to propFind and not to preloadCollection, which the server emits from Nextcloud 32 on before it reads the children of a collection. Without that listener a PROPFIND with Depth above 0 runs the queries of the plugin once per child.",
        "  lib/Dav/ApprovalPlugin.php:32 OCA\\Approval\\Dav\\ApprovalPlugin"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "boot-listener",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/AppInfo/Application.php:80 get()",
        "lib/AppInfo/Application.php:81 addListener()",
        "lib/AppInfo/Application.php:86 get()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "boot() registers a listener or takes a service from the container in 3 places. boot() runs once for every process of the server, so each of them is built on every request. registerEventListener() in register() builds a listener only when its event fires.",
        "  lib/AppInfo/Application.php:80 get()",
        "  lib/AppInfo/Application.php:81 addListener()",
        "  lib/AppInfo/Application.php:86 get()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-tools-in-root",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "psalm/phar, phpunit/phpunit are in require-dev of composer.json. The manual recommends a vendor-bin/ of bamarni/composer-bin-plugin per tool, so that the dependencies of a tool cannot conflict with those of the app."
      ]
    },
